# Security & ops hygiene

- Never commit `.env.local`, credentials, or production secrets.
- Device credentials / ingest keys: rotate/migrate only via documented guides (`docs/guide/`, `docs/security/`).
- Prefer existing runbooks under `docs/guide/` and `docs/operations/` over new process files.
- Shared `INGEST_SECRET` remains an open exception until per-device credentials are verified — see `api-contracts.mdc`.
- Tenant isolation and Convex Auth details: `multi-tenant-security.mdc`. Deploy gates: `deployment-safety.mdc`.
